; haltsql-server.siem tests.
;  test_siem_unit: pure tests (CRC-32C, murmur2, RecordBatch v2, Kafka response
;    decoding, SCRAM RFC 7677 / PBKDF2 RFC 7914 vectors, _bulk body and item
;    classification, engine policies with a scripted in-process transport).
;  test_siem_kafka: the real apache/kafka (KRaft) in Docker on host ports
;    19092-19094: plaintext, SASL/SCRAM-SHA-256/512 + PLAIN over TLS with a test
;    CA, consumption with kafka-console-consumer, broker restarts.
;  test_siem_es: the real Elasticsearch (security + TLS, API key) on 19200 and
;    OpenSearch on 19201: query back, mapping conflicts, per-item retries,
;    cluster down.
; The Docker tests skip (with a message) when Docker is unavailable or
; HALTSQL_SIEM_SKIP_DOCKER=1. HALTSQL_SIEM_KEEP_CONTAINERS=1 keeps containers.

(tests
 (names test_siem_unit test_siem_kafka test_siem_es)
 (package haltsql-server)
 (deps verify_chain.py)
 (libraries
  haltsql_siem
  haltsql_cloud
  haltsql.load
  alcotest
  lwt
  lwt.unix
  yojson
  digestif
  base64
  x509
  ipaddr
  ptime
  ptime.clock.os
  uri
  mirage-crypto-rng
  mirage-crypto-rng.unix
  unix))
